Benchmark corpus — third-party sources
======================================

The Kotlin files in this directory are used SOLELY as input fixtures for
ktfmt's performance benchmarks. They are not compiled into, executed by, or
distributed as part of ktfmt. Each is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, by its respective copyright holders.

Layout
------
  original/  Unmodified snapshots pinned to a specific upstream release tag, in
             each project's own style. ktfmt must reformat these. This is the
             corpus, spanning a size range and distinct formatter code paths
             (ordinary code, KDoc reflow, multiline strings, ...). The
             idempotency benchmark derives its already-formatted ("preformatted")
             inputs at runtime by running ktfmt over these to a fixed point.

Pinning to fixed tags keeps benchmark scores comparable across ktfmt revisions.

